                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The New Colossus has great graphics and solid gameplay. The gunplay is satisfying, and the combat is genuinely fun. Unfortunately, the writing and characters are a major disappointment.\n\nMany characters are incredibly obnoxious, with unpleasant personalities that make their interactions more frustrating than entertaining. The story often feels poorly written, and B.J. himself comes across as strangely passive in situations where he should stand up for himself. All these interactions are awkward and uncomfortable to watch.\n\nTo make matters worse, the game crashes whenever I die during certain missions, turning an already frustrating experience into an even worse one.\n\nUltimately, the game has a solid foundation, but its unpleasant characters, questionable writing, and technical issues make it difficult to enjoy the experience as a whole.",
